  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">South Sudan humanitarian and resilience programme (SSHARP)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Under the South Sudan Humanitarian Assistance and Resilience Programme (SSHARP), the proposed intervention aims to prevent, reduce, and mitigate serious health risks and associated protection concerns among vulnerable people but also to enhance equitable provision and sustainability of service delivery by facilitating a transition from humanitarian assistance that primarily focuses on IDPs to greater ownership, leadership, and management by state governments and communities.</narrative>
  </description>
